Terminal output captured from picture programs, one file per run: chafa,
timg, kitty's icat, mpv and img2sixel showing the test images, with the
queries they send answered as a terminal without pictures, as one with
sixel, as one with sixel and kitty, or not at all (the name says which).
They are input for test-vte-same, which checks that libtsm gives the same
screen with and without the picture interfaces. The files that also exist
in ../sixel and ../kitty are identical to those.
